  "id": 8,
  "title": "Describing things",
  "goal": "Describe people and things by colour, size and quality, make adjectives agree, and compare (bigger, the biggest).",
  "intro": "Gujarati adjectives come before the noun. Adjectives ending in **-ઉં / -ો / -ી** change to agree with the noun's gender and number (**સારો** છોકરો, **સારી** છોકરી, **સારું** ઘર), while adjectives ending in other sounds never change (**લાલ** ગાડી, **લાલ** ફૂલ).\n\nComparison is easy: 'X is bigger than Y' is 'X Y-**કરતાં** big is'.",
